id: pm-rust-portable-native-adapter-abi
title: Use authorized remote backends through a portable native adapter ABI
description: "Core owns backend contracts; pm-web and MCP own transports. Rust interoperability only: no new backend or replacement pm-web client."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[3]: adapter,interop,sdk
created_at: "2026-10-24T11:48:18.127Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-24T13:21:25.564Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: "Synthetic remote adapters preserve refusal and receipt semantics; Unsupported capabilities fail before writes; ABI compatibility is checked; Typed SDK and bounded TOON/JSON CLI with actionable refusals, docs and example; Read-only public tracker copy validated without Git; npm and Bun release gates pass"
parent: pm-rust-u4al
comments[8]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-24T11:48:21.365Z",codex-agent,"Overlap check: searched existing tracker items for adapter ABI and portable; no duplicate. Inspected pinned SDK 2026.10.21, current 2026.10.24 public exports, core workspace/runtime contracts, pm-web PmRunResult/complete-list receipt handling, and core MCP adapters. Core owns command/backend semantics, authorization and mutation receipts; pm-web/MCP own network transports. Implement a versioned bounded JSON byte boundary for caller-supplied authorized native adapters. No backend, HTTP client, shared cache, persistent lease or outbox is introduced. Rust SDK changes follow this native repository; validation tooling remains erasable TypeScript."
  "2026-10-24T12:02:04.204Z",codex-agent,"Implemented the versioned bounded JSON byte ABI, typed get/list/claim/release operations, pre-dispatch admission, unchanged backend envelopes, and explicit dispatched/unknown-outcome refusals with no retries. Added offline adapter-check CLI; it reports compatibility only, never execution. No shared tracker state is written by the boundary. The authoritative native release SDK follows tracker policy, so release capability requires strict owner enforcement; the synthetic remote adapter tests enforce this inside core locking. Tests inject competing claims and release-and-claim handoffs at every one of six adapter boundaries on one non-git tracker. Added readonly public-copy validation using the real complete-list SDK certificate and native children without Git or Node."
  "2026-10-24T12:07:55.763Z",codex-agent,"Read-only public-copy validation passed at public source ec39af2b06d3884c466b5770b41e1cdb745f1cd6: 83 certified items, 172 authoritative files, 4234972 bytes, 9 pages, 92 adapter calls, 184 JSON/TOON CLI checks, 880680 response bytes, 88935-byte largest frame, 193-byte largest CLI receipt, 5687 ms. Native children had neither Git nor Node on PATH. Source SHA-256 remained 4efdd31a9fd67caefced2b9852a38c6709f4452e2ecb519433be00bbd61d3607. Targeted suite now has 8 passing tests including 12 shared-tracker interleavings and a foreign-owner release guard. Revert proof independently removed capability admission, exact ABI comparison and outcome preservation; each selected regression failed by assertion, then source was restored. Cargo check, deny-warning clippy, fmt, strict TypeScript and ESLint pass. No SDK bump or shared state was introduced. Full npm/Bun gates will run in CI because local CPU is saturated."
  "2026-10-24T12:31:21.192Z",codex-agent,"Initial CI run 40092834320 passed all three platform test suites and all latency checks, but release coverage refused two unexecuted manifest-error propagation regions in the new ABI client/preflight. Keep all thresholds unchanged; add targeted incompatible-manifest constructor/admission paths and rerun CI. No production mutation or receipt regression was reported."
  "2026-10-24T12:45:53.397Z",codex-agent,"Coverage correction complete: incompatible manifest constructor/preflight paths now prove zero backend dispatch. Added two CLI tests covering all 19 missing-tracker command paths and injected stdin, initial write, trailing newline, flush and codec failures. CLI writes now propagate pipe errors. Generic clients delegate to one shared validated exchange path without changing the public API or wire ABI. Targeted instrumented run passes 8 ABI tests plus 2 CLI tests; native_adapter.rs has 146/146 lines, 17/17 functions, 211/211 regions and 20/20 branches covered. New CLI helper regions and tracker-discovery error propagations are covered; full-repository coverage remains for CI. Read-only public-copy validation repeated: identical 83 items, 9 pages, 92 calls, 184 checks, 193-byte maximum CLI receipt and unchanged source hash; latest elapsed sample 5301 ms."
  "2026-10-24T12:50:25.942Z",codex-agent,"Final behavioral proof expansion passed 5/5: removing capability admission, exact ABI checking, canonical outcome preservation, tracker-free CLI dispatch, or CLI flush-error propagation each causes the selected regression to fail by assertion. Both source files are restored byte-for-byte after proof; the 8-test ABI suite and 2-test CLI suite pass. Strict TypeScript and ESLint pass for both validation tools. Retaining unchanged full release gates for final CI."
  "2026-10-24T13:14:09.954Z",codex-agent,"Final-head CI 40095607106 confirms ABI coverage passes, but the complete gate reports 21 uncovered CLI regions despite pooled source spans showing none. Diagnosis: adapter command dispatch and successful receipt paths were exercised only by CLI processes, while unit tests covered only refusal paths. Added direct dispatcher tests with caller-owned streams for successful and refused JSON/TOON checks in a plain directory. All existing workspace behavior remains delegated unchanged. Rechecking the complete CLI unit target and ABI target under instrumentation before another full CI run; thresholds remain unchanged."
  "2026-10-24T13:21:24.608Z",codex-agent,"Dispatcher correction verified: direct JSON/TOON command-dispatch success and refusal cases now exercise the same injected-stream path as process dispatch. Targeted instrumentation passes the complete CLI unit target (37), black-box CLI dispatch (17) and ABI contract (8); ABI module remains 100 percent in all four required dimensions. All four linked pm test commands pass, including 5/5 behavioral revert proofs and the two focused adapter CLI tests. Rebuilt both native CLI and example, then repeated readonly public-copy validation: unchanged 83 items, 172 files, 4234972 bytes, 9 pages, 92 adapter calls, 184 CLI checks, 880680 response bytes, largest frame 88935, largest CLI receipt 193; elapsed sample 4117 ms; authoritative source hash unchanged. Static checks and formatting pass. Full repository npm/Bun evidence remains the CI acceptance gate."
